WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.290
Welcome to the Field Station!

2
00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.010
Here's how every science lesson works.

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.460
Start at the top.

4
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.940
Read the Big Question and your I can goals.

5
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.220
Type your first name to get your Field Station badge.

6
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.260
Each week, a scientist on our crew
sends you a case to solve.

7
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.630
As you work, you'll find clues.

8
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.300
Watch them fill in on the My Clues bar.

9
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.860
Go through the tabs in order: Warm-Up,
The Lesson, Self-Check, then Assignment.

10
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.140
Press Listen to hear the crew.

11
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:34.220
Press Read aloud if you want
the page read to you.

12
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.380
Use Highlight to mark important words,
Sketch to draw,

13
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.500
and Snap to save a picture of what you find.

14
00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.070
Try every activity.

15
00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:46.780
If an answer isn't quite right,
a hint tells you where to look.

16
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.770
On the Assignment tab, answer each part.

17
00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.820
Your answers save as you type.

18
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.660
Then write your claim, your evidence,
and your reasoning.

19
00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:00.540
Last, copy your Gathered Answers into Canvas,
and check What to Turn In.

20
00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.400
Ready? Let's crack the case!
